    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "The thinnest ground the survey has walked on Driftholt: ten landform marks on the whole region against seventeen and twelve on the other two, and the chart's own point count stops short of its floor here and is declared as doing so. What there is is meadow \u2014 more of it, at 95.2 per cent, than any other ground on the island, walked or reported \u2014 and the two flat-topped hills, whose faces are the one place on this region metal is reachable and, unusually, give no building stone with it."
  },
